      "dom_id": "step-q39212",
      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "Given $x=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -2 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]$, find $‖x‖.$",
      "worked_solution": "Using the formula for the norm, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}‖x‖ & =\\sqrt{{x}_{1}^{2}+{x}_{2}^{2}+{x}_{3}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{2}^{2}+(-2)^{2}+(-1)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{4+4+1} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{9} \\\\  & =3.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
