      "name": "Question 4",
      "problem": "Given $c=[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]$, find $‖c‖.$",
      "worked_solution": "Using the formula for the norm, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}‖c‖ & =\\sqrt{{c}_{1}^{2}+{c}_{2}^{2}+{c}_{3}^{2}+{c}_{4}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{4}^{2}+{2}^{2}+{1}^{2}+(-2)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{16+4+1+4} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{25} \\\\  & =5.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
